Silver items will do silver damage to silver-hating creatures.  Monks
may especially like the silver ring, since it applies to bare-handed
attacks.  If I recall correctly, though, you can't be wearing gloves
at the time of the attack to get silver damage from a ring.  There are
plenty of little hidden abilities you'll run into like this in
nethack.

